OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Fblustery showers, some heavy
OL,7,Fespecially across Northern Argyll,
OL,8,FInverclyde and around Loch Lomond. A
OL,9,Ffew sunny intervals too especially in
OL,10,Fafternoon. A very windy day too with
OL,11,Fsouthwesterly gales, easing later on.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFurther blustery showers this
OL,14,Fevening and tonight, along with a few
OL,15,Fclear intervals. Strong southwesterly
OL,16,Fwinds, with coastal gales possible for
OL,17,Fa time overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
