OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,6,Fand further showers, most frequent in
OL,7,FArgyll but becoming more scattered in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon as winds continue to
OL,9,Fease down.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,13,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,14,FSome sunshine around too. A dry start
OL,15,FFriday then rain spreading from west.
OL,16,FRain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
